    "Thinking about the problem, I converged to the following model of the density distribution:\n",
    "\n",
    "p(D) = p(D| c=0)p(c=0) + p(D| c=1)p(c=1)\n",
    "\n",
    "     = pi_0 * Exp(lambda) + (1-pi_0) * TruncatedNormal(mu, sigma)\n",
    "\n",
    "with \n",
    "\n",
    "pi_0 ~ Beta(1,1)\n",
    "\n",
    "lambda ~ Gamma(2,3)\n",
    "\n",
    "sigma ~ HalfNormal(0,0.1)"
   ]
